    _apply_theme "info" "CBB is a lightweight emergency communication system for use when the main blockchain has stalled."
    _apply_theme "warn" "警告：CBB 上的消息未经主链共识，不保证全局一致性，且会在24小时后自动过期。"
    _apply_theme "warn" "WARNING: Messages on CBB are NOT confirmed by main-chain consensus, do not guarantee global consistency, and expire after 24 hours."
