    _apply_theme "primary" "  game new [--invite <id>] - 创建一个新游戏，您可以选择邀请一位对手。/ Create a new game, optionally inviting an opponent."
    _apply_theme "primary" "  game view <game_id>      - 查看一个游戏当前的棋盘状态 / View the current board state of a game."
    _apply_theme "primary" "  game move <game_id> <pos>  - 在游戏中走一步。位置是 1-9。 / Make a move in a game. Position is 1-9."
